# Aqua Sort — Game Economy, Undo System & Time/Move Limits

Enhance the Aqua Sort game with visible time limit + move count HUD, a gated undo system (2 free, then premium/ads), and a coin economy driven by ad watching.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **No ad SDK integration** — Since `google_mobile_ads` is not in the project and requires platform-specific setup (AdMob IDs, `AndroidManifest.xml`, `Info.plist`), this plan **simulates** the ad flow with a realistic delay + confirmation dialog. When you're ready to go live with real ads, we swap the stub for the real SDK. This keeps the game fully functional and testable now.

> [!WARNING]
> **Premium status** — There's currently no `isPremium` flag on the user model. This plan adds one locally via `SharedPreferences` (with a stub "Go Premium" button). Real in-app purchase integration (RevenueCat / StoreKit) is a separate task.

