### Game Provider — Undo Gating & Ad Flow

#### [MODIFY] [game_provider.dart](file:///c:/Users/vivek/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/aqua-sort-flutter/lib/features/game/providers/game_provider.dart)

Current `undo()` method is ungated. Changes:

1. Rename existing `undo()` → `_performUndo()` (private, always executes)
2. New public `requestUndo(int playerIdx, BuildContext context)`:
   - If `undosUsed < 2` → call `_performUndo()` directly (free)
   - If `undosUsed >= 2`:
     - Check `isPremium` → unlimited undos, call `_performUndo()`
     - Check if player has `>= 50 coins` → show "Use 50 coins?" confirmation → deduct & undo
     - Otherwise → show "Watch Ad or Go Premium" bottom sheet
3. New `rewardAdCoins(BuildContext context)`:
   - Calls `AdService.showRewardedAd()`
   - On success, awards `25 coins` via `LevelNotifier.awardCoins()`

