## Economy Balance Sheet

| Action | Coins |
|--------|-------|
| Complete a level (base) | +30 |
| Moves efficiency bonus | +10 to +30 |
| Speed bonus | +10 to +30 |
| Milestone bonus (every 5th level) | +50 |
| Watch an ad | +25 |
| Daily login claim | +50 |
| Extra undo (beyond 2 free) | -50 |
| Skin purchase (standard) | -500 |
| Skin purchase (premium) | -1500 |
| Skin purchase (legendary) | -3000 |

**Player earns ~30-90 coins/level + 25/ad. An extra undo costs 50 coins (≈ 1 level or 2 ads). This makes undos accessible but not free, encouraging strategic play.**

